{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"機電署派員到場調查　政府要求港鐵交報告\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/GOV-MTR-261119-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】政府表示關注港島綫香港大學站接連出現同類信號設備部件問題，影響列車服務。</p><p>機電工程署已派員到場調查，初步顯示不涉及鐵路安全事宜。政府已要求港鐵深入調查事故原因，全面報告跟進工作和改善措施，防止同類情況再次發生。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:58:56.430138+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:20:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T18:37:34.826979+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:52:26.560160+00:00","content_hash":"b5e55b2096253a39d9b0e197890178d0c03f383181994fc4fa4be1f6e561e8b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:58:56.430138+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}